  html=`<span class="badge">${esc(p.category)}</span><h2>${esc(p.name)}</h2><p>${esc(p.role)}</p><dl class="facts">${fact('Organism',species(p.species)?.name||'Identity unresolved')}${fact('Accession',p.accession||'No unique accession')}${fact('Reference organism / strain',p.reference?.organism?.scientificName||'Unresolved; inspect original source material')}${fact('Compartment',p.localization)}${fact('Placement',placement.zone+'; exact pose unknown')}</dl>${sh?`${context.kind==='network'?'<button data-focus-protein>Look around this fold</button>':''}<button class="enter" data-enter="protein:${id}">Enter source-coordinate space →</button><span class="badge ${sh.kind==='prediction'?'warm':''}">${esc(sh.kind)}</span><p>${esc(sh.state||sh.admission)}<br><code>${esc(sh.id)}</code></p><p class="limit">${esc(sh.scope)}</p>`:'<span class="badge warm">COORDINATES UNAVAILABLE</span><p>No source shape is substituted. The marker represents an entry, not a fold.</p>'}<h3>What remains unknown</h3><p class="limit">${esc(p.caveat)}</p><p>${esc(placement.note)}</p>${sourceLinks(p.source_ids)}${studyContext([id])}<details><summary>Recorded relationships · ${rs.length}</summary>${rs.map(recordHTML).join('')}</details>`;
